3637 0 obj
<<
/Title (Yes. Practical 8 uses PDO, prepared statements, and prepare\(\)/execute\(\) instead of directly inserting user input into SQL queries. This helps prevent SQL Injection. Passwords are also stored using password_hash\(\) rather than as plain text.)
/Dest [51 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3628 0 R
>>
endobj
